            ╭ D E T A I L ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
            │  Download Video  [built-in]                                                                  │
            │  Download video or audio from URLs using yt-dlp. Supports YouTube, m3u8/HLS streams, and     │
            │  hundreds of sites. CLI only.                                                                │
            │                                                                                              │
            │  PARAMETERS                                                                                  │
            │                                                                                              │
            │  > Video URL                                                                                 │
            │      https://youtube.com/watch?v=...                                                         │
            │                                                                                              │
            │    Output Format   MP4 (H.264)                                                               │
            │      Video container format                                                                  │
            │                                                                                              │
            │    Video Codec   H.264                                                                       │
            │                                                                                              │
            │    Audio Codec   M4A (AAC)                                                                   │
            │                                                                                              │
            │    Browser Cookies   None                                                                    │
            │      Use cookies from a browser for authenticated content (Patreon, private videos)          │
            │                                                                                              │
            │    Quality Cap   Best available                                                              │
            │      Maximum video resolution (best available if unset)                                      │
            │                                                                                              │
